    "description": "To determine the effect of the major chromosomes on size variation, we established backcrosses between F1 females (progeny of crosses between D. novamexicana males and D. americana females) and D. novamexicana males. A total of 570 females were dissected and phenotyped for eye, face and wing areas, as well as for tibiae lengths as described above.",
